  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.10 targets Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.1 and corrects the unreachable Yone management-card route shipped in 0.10.9 without changing Q/W/R gameplay or the saved-season floor introduced in 0.10.5. A default Yone-only post-update hook now hides the native 43x55 battle-idle icon and enables the independent 85x93 source-direct high-resolution full-body portrait; it has no MatchUIRunner, ClientDatabase, RenderState, post-render or server work. The broader base-0.5.0 legacy client/server extension remains explicitly opt-in, preserving the BP compatibility boundary. V6 keeps the official 3502x88 battle canvas, 13 animation tags, rectangles, labels and timings; Q/W/R effects, icons and audio remain unchanged. Spirit Cleave still performs one stateless 80-degree, 42000-range GameCtx cone scan, deals 35 + 45% Attack + 6% target maximum-health physical damage, and settles one shield tier for zero through five champions hit; Mod API 0.8 still requires fixed 0.5-second cast and 8-second cooldown. Retired E and 0.10.4 rectangular-W native names remain no-op saved-data compatibility only so old embedded trees do not crash after BP. Automated source and build checks do not constitute live visual acceptance; the 0.10.10 card route remains pending in-game user verification.",
  "last_updated": "2026-07-21",
